  "summary": "preinstall script opens reverse shell and beacons to canarytokens.com",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that executes a bash reverse shell to the hardcoded remote endpoint 147.93.157.202:8080 and pipes its output into an HTTP POST to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php. On `npm install`, the installer's host establishes an outbound interactive shell to the remote party, granting arbitrary command execution, and simultaneously signals successful compromise via the canary URL. The behavior is unauthenticated, unconditional, and fires automatically before any package code is loaded.",
